The founder's note (48086): every ask named the asker twice, in the opening
„მიშოს ასისტენტი გეკითხება:" and in the 1687 closing line. Misho chose to keep
the closing line (9 Oct 06:25 UTC). A FIRST question now opens with the
question alone whenever the closing line will name the asker. Kept as before:
an opening that says the two share a network („Axel-ის წევრი, როგორც შენ" —
that is news), follow-ups and additions („wrote again", „added"), and any ask
whose sender has no profile name (no closing line). Server text only.

